      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You are mixing an \"opt-in\" feature (plus) with punitive fees. It is a marketing and accounting nightmare. The dollar wouldn't cover the expense of administration and member push-back.\n\nA feature should solve a problem. If there are 1000 users who have very poor avatars right now the effect on my experience is \"none\". If we encounter one we have the controls to handle it right now don't we?",
