  "details": "Simple concept \n\nYou must pay vrchat a one-dollar-a-month pass to use very poor avatars\n\nAnd/or 1 dollar one-time permanent fee for every single specific verypoor avatar you choose, if you aren't a membership kind of person yk (doesn't expire when an avatar/blueprint-id is updated) \n\nObjective\n\nVrchat get small amount more money\n\nLack of optimization penalized but the fees are so low so it's not harsh\n\nImagine having a VeryPoor avatar clearance card that's just a funny idea if love to see that as a prop\n\nComment section below 👇 guys \n\nDo you think quest users should be exempt from this if it should ever come?",
